# Cloud-sync conflict artifacts (defense-in-depth only)
# -----------------------------------------------------
# The real fix is never developing inside a synced folder (iCloud Drive,
# Dropbox, OneDrive) — see docs/engineering/repository-location-and-cloud-sync.md.
# Only PRECISE, unambiguous conflict markers are listed here; broad patterns
# (e.g. any name ending in a space + number) are deliberately NOT used because
# they could hide legitimate files.
#
# iCloud not-yet-downloaded placeholders — always ".<name>.icloud", never a
# real source file:
*.icloud
.*.icloud
# Dropbox conflicted copies — filename literally contains "conflicted copy",
# e.g. "graph (Sara's conflicted copy 2026-01-01).py":
*conflicted copy*

# Local repository inspection reports
project-tree.txt
markdown-files.txt
